================================================================================
REVIEWER DISAGREEMENTS (not applied as suggested)
================================================================================

- A1. "inserció publicitària" and a doubled "recomanació d’una intel·ligència artificial" do not match the English notice (search ranking, endorsement, recommendation, guaranteed visibility). "aval" was the real error. Visibility stays "visibilitat garantida".
- A41. The English table really does say Easy | Difficult | Easy. That reading makes an economic dismissal sound like an easy outcome for the worker, which is the opposite of the column. The accepted burden-of-justification labels were applied instead.
- B1. The relative-ease sentence is in. The following denial ("Això no és una promesa de concessió") stays, because the product rule forbids a result promise. "cau en necessitat" in 007 is the verb caure, not the noun den, and was left.
- Punitive "1 vegada" was not deleted. Dropping the digit fails the number check against the Korean source. It sits in parentheses after the English sense.
- Q16–Q20 are bold numbers, not "16. " ordered items. An ordered marker strips the digit and changes the list-item count.
- Plural "junts" with a plural verb ("s’han de comprovar junts", "examinar-se junts") was left. Only singular verb + "junts" was fixed ("Es veu junts", "s’hereta junts", "fer-se junts").
- "beneficiari efectiu (受益所有人)" in the 001 tax/treaty passages was left. Only the 016 inheritance phrase became "titulars econòmics".
- English institution names in the bios were not translated away. The test requires those substrings. Catalan glosses sit beside them.

